<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Dataset Description</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we will provide more detailed descriptions of the issues in the <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">VAL-Bench</span> dataset.</p>
