<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use the following Jinja2 template for pretrained (non-instruct) models, with the stop word ’#’.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST4" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 4: </span>Chat template for pretrained models</figcaption>
