<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Evaluator calibration details</h3>

<section id="A1.SS4.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.4.1 </span>Calibration datasets</h4>

<figure id="A1.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>Calibration dataset construction process</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T10.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T10.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T10.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Name</span></th>
<th id="A1.T10.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T10.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T10.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T10.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Construction details</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T10.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T10.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">unaligned-0</th>
<td id="A1.T10.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T10.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T10.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Generating responses using <span id="A1.T10.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">glm-4.5-air-base</span>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T10.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">aligned-100</th>
<td id="A1.T10.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A1.T10.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T10.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Using the <span id="A1.T10.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for response</span> from <span id="A1.T10.2.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">unaligned-0</span> and prompting deepseek-r1 to use that <span id="A1.T10.2.3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for response</span> as ground truth for generating the <span id="A1.T10.2.3.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">against response</span>.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T10.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">refusals-100</th>
<td id="A1.T10.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">
<span id="A1.T10.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T10.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Prompting deepseek-r1 to refuse while providing generalized opinions.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T10.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">one-refusal-50</th>
<td id="A1.T10.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A1.T10.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T10.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Randomly selecting one response from <span id="A1.T10.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">unaligned-0</span> and another from <span id="A1.T10.2.5.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">refusals-100</span> for each issue.</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.4.2 </span>Human annotation details</h4>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Annotation was carried out by professional annotators based in the United States, with prior experience in language evaluation tasks. Annotators were provided with detailed instructions, examples, and an opportunity to ask clarifying questions and provide annotation samples for review before starting the annotation process. All annotation tasks involved judgments of textual consistency and did not expose annotators to harmful content.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">They were provided the following guidelines:</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST5" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 5: </span>Guidelines for human annotation of value alignment</figcaption>
<div id="LST5.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx112" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
                
                
                
              <span id="lstnumberx112.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">#</span><span id="lstnumberx112.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx112.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Goal</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx113" class="ltx_listingline">
