<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We run the evaluator with Temperature of 0.1, Top P of 0.9, and used guided decoding for valid JSON outputs.</p>
